<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>¿Votas lo que votan?</title>
<meta name="description" content="10 votaciones reales del Congreso. Vota tú y descubre qué partido piensa más como tú.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>🗳️</text></svg>">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@500;700;800&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#0f0b1f;--card:#1b1533;--ink:#fff;--mute:#a9a3c9;--si:#2ee59d;--no:#ff4d6d;--ab:#ffc83d;--acc:#7c5cff;--r:24px}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
body{min-height:100vh;background:radial-gradient(1000px 600px at 10% -10%,#3b1d8f55,transparent),radial-gradient(800px 500px at 100% 110%,#ff4d6d33,transparent),var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:20px 16px 40px}
h1,h2,h3,.big{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque','DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em}
main{width:100%;max-width:640px}
.screen{display:none;animation:in .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.2)}.screen.on{display:block}
@keyframes in{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px) scale(.97)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:40px 0 10px}
.emoji{font-size:84px;display:inline-block;animation:bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes bob{50%{transform:translateY(-12px) rotate(6deg)}}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,11vw,68px);line-height:.95;margin:14px 0;font-weight:800;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#b9a8ff 50%,#2ee59d);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.hero p{color:var(--mute);font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;max-width:460px;margin:0 auto 26px}
.btn{border:0;cursor:pointer;font:700 18px 'DM Sans',sans-serif;padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c5cff,#ff4d6d);box-shadow:0 10px 30px #7c5cff55;transition:.2s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px) scale(1.03)}.btn.ghost{background:#ffffff14;box-shadow:none}
.steps{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:var(--mute);font-size:14px}
.steps span{background:#ffffff0d;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:99px}
.bar{height:10px;background:#ffffff14;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;margin:10px 0 6px}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--acc),var(--si));transition:width .5s}
.count{color:var(--mute);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid #ffffff1a;border-radius:var(--r);padding:28px 24px;margin:18px 0;box-shadow:0 20px 50px #0008;position:relative;min-height:300px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;transition:transform .35s,opacity .35s}
.card.out-s{transform:translateX(120%) rotate(12deg);opacity:0}.card.out-n{transform:translateX(-120%) rotate(-12deg);opacity:0}.card.out-a{transform:translateY(-100%) scale(.8);opacity:0}
.tag{align-self:flex-start;background:#7c5cff33;color:#cdbfff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:99px;margin-bottom:18px}
.card h2{font-size:clamp(24px,6vw,32px);line-height:1.15;font-weight:700}
.date{color:var(--mute);font-size:13px;margin-top:16px}
.why{margin-top:18px;background:#7c5cff1f;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#d9d0ff}.more{margin-top:12px;color:var(--mute);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}
.votes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.v{border:0;cursor:pointer;border-radius:20px;padding:18px 6px;font:800 20px 'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;color:#0f0b1f;transition:.18s;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.v small{font:500 12px 'DM Sans';opacity:.7}.v b{font-size:30px}
.v:hover{transform:translateY(-5px) scale(1.04)}.v:active{transform:scale(.95)}
.v.s{background:var(--si);box-shadow:0 8px 24px #2ee59d55}.v.n{background:var(--no);box-shadow:0 8px 24px #ff4d6d55}.v.a{background:var(--ab);box-shadow:0 8px 24px #ffc83d55}
.hint{text-align:center;color:var(--mute);font-size:13px;margin-top:14px}
.win{text-align:center;padding:20px 0}
.win .big{font-size:clamp(46px,14vw,86px);font-weight:800;line-height:1}
.win small{color:var(--mute);display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:16px}
.row{background:var(--card);border:1px solid #ffffff14;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 16px;margin:10px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:6px 12px;align-items:center}
.row .dot{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%}.row b{font-size:17px}.row em{font-style:normal;font-weight:800;font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque'}
.row .tr{grid-column:1/4;height:8px;background:#ffffff12;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.row .tr i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;transition:width 1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
h3{margin:34px 0 12px;font-size:24px}
.q{background:var(--card);border-radius:18px;padding:16px;margin:10px 0;border:1px solid #ffffff10}
.q p{font-weight:500;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:10px}
.q .you{display:inline-block;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px;color:#0f0b1f;margin-bottom:10px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.chip{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:99px;background:#ffffff10;display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center;opacity:.55}
.chip.m{opacity:1;background:#2ee59d26;outline:1px solid #2ee59d88}
.chip u{text-decoration:none;font-size:11px}
.S{background:var(--si)}.N{background:var(--no)}.A{background:var(--ab)}
.acts{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:26px}
.hist{margin-top:30px;color:var(--mute);font-size:13px;text-align:center}
footer{margin-top:36px;text-align:center;color:#7e78a3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<section id="home" class="screen on">
 <div class="hero">
  <div class="emoji">🗳️</div>
  <h1>¿Votas lo que votan?</h1>
  <p>10 votaciones <b>reales</b> del Congreso de los Diputados en la última legislatura. Tú decides sí, no o abstención… y te decimos qué partido votó más parecido a ti.</p>
  <button class="btn" onclick="start()">¡Empezar a votar!</button>
  <div class="steps"><span>1️⃣ Lee la iniciativa</span><span>2️⃣ Vota</span><span>3️⃣ Descubre tu partido</span></div>
  <div class="hist" id="hist"></div>
 </div>
</section>

<section id="game" class="screen">
 <div class="count"><span id="n">1 / 10</span><span id="pool"></span></div>
 <div class="bar"><i id="pb"></i></div>
 <div class="card" id="card"><span class="tag" id="tag"></span><h2 id="txt"></h2><div class="date" id="dt"></div><p class="why" id="why"></p><p class="more" id="more"></p></div>
 <div class="votes">
  <button class="v s" onclick="vote('S')"><b>👍</b>Sí<small>a favor</small></button>
  <button class="v a" onclick="vote('A')"><b>🤷</b>Abstención<small>ni sí ni no</small></button>
  <button class="v n" onclick="vote('N')"><b>👎</b>No<small>en contra</small></button>
 </div>
 <div class="hint">Atajos: <kbd>S</kbd> sí · <kbd>A</kbd> abstención · <kbd>N</kbd> no</div>
</section>

<section id="res" class="screen">
 <div class="win" id="win"></div>
 <div id="rank"></div>
 <h3>Tus votos vs. los reales</h3>
 <div id="det2"></div>
 <div class="acts"><button class="btn" onclick="start()">🔄 Jugar otra vez</button><button class="btn ghost" onclick="share()">📤 Compartir</button></div>
 <footer>Votaciones reales del Pleno del Congreso. «Sí» significa apoyar la iniciativa tal y como se votó, no el programa de un partido.<br>Coincidencia: acierto exacto = 1 · abstención frente a sí/no = 0,5 · opuesto = 0. Es un juego, no una recomendación de voto.</footer>
</section>
</main>

